  "description": "Bidirectional realtime RPC over raw WebSockets for .NET 10. Call server methods from a client and client methods from the server - with return values, groups, broadcast, timeouts, keepalive and auto-reconnect - over a small JSON protocol that a browser can speak in ten lines. Allocation-free in steady state. Client SDKs for Python, Go and Node.js included. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
